From: OpenWrt MT6990 enablement
Subject: mt76: mt7996: use MT6990 board firmware and EEPROM

Select the factory-qualified firmware and EEPROM for the MT6990 endpoint
identified by subsystem 14c3:6639. Other MT7996 cards retain upstream files.
When the complete board EEPROM is used, do not overlay unsupported ADIE
cal-free EFUSE reads.

